212
00:17:07,167 --> 00:17:11,887
優しさに満ち溢れてる
Overflowing with kindness,

213
00:17:12,467 --> 00:17:16,507
青い地球にありがとう
thank you to the blue earth.

214
00:17:17,187 --> 00:17:24,067
You can smile again 太陽浴びて
You can smile again, bathing in the sun,

215
00:17:24,847 --> 00:17:31,427
You can fly away 世界は君の輝きを待ってる
You can fly away, the world is waiting for your radiance.

216
00:17:32,107 --> 00:17:35,827
大地を踏みしめて
Treading firmly on the earth,

217
00:17:36,247 --> 00:17:39,087
君は目覚めていく
you begin to awaken.

218
00:17:39,327 --> 00:17:44,867
天使の微笑みで連れ出して！
Lured out by an angel's smile!

219
00:17:45,347 --> 00:17:51,347
“始まり”はいつでも遅くないさ
"Beginnings" are never too late,

220
00:17:51,347 --> 00:17:56,307
何度でも立ち上がれ！
stand up as many times as it takes!

221
00:18:07,327 --> 00:18:11,987
最後まであきらめないさ
Never give up until the very end.

222
00:18:12,407 --> 00:18:18,187
やり続けることに必ず意味がある
There is always a meaning in keeping on.

223
00:18:18,627 --> 00:18:24,267
You just try again 闇を抜けて
You just try again, passing through the darkness,

224
00:18:24,667 --> 00:18:31,847
You just go away 未来はいつも僕たちを待ってる
You just go away, the future is always waiting for us.

225
00:18:32,307 --> 00:18:36,067
大空駆け抜けて
Rushing through the open skies,

226
00:18:36,467 --> 00:18:39,147
雲原超えてゆけ
crossing over the sea of clouds.

227
00:18:39,347 --> 00:18:45,067
天使の投げキス捕まえて
