まだ誰も見たことない世界へ飛び出そう明日へ
let's leap toward tomorrow into a world no one has ever seen.

229
00:18:52,487 --> 00:18:56,147
大地を踏みしめて
Treading firmly on the earth,

230
00:18:56,427 --> 00:18:59,087
飛び出そう明日へ
let's leap toward tomorrow!

231
00:18:57,407 --> 00:19:02,227
大地を踏みしめて 君は目覚めていく
Treading firmly on the earth, you begin to awaken.

232
00:19:02,427 --> 00:19:08,567
天使の微笑みで連れ出して 終わらない冒険に
Lured out by an angel's smile into an endless adventure!

233
00:19:09,347 --> 00:19:21,047
出掛けよう いつまでもどこまでも
Let's set out, forever and ever.

234
00:19:33,487 --> 00:19:40,447
流れ落ちる涙 勇気に変えていく
Turning falling tears into courage,

235
00:19:40,867 --> 00:19:49,067
天使の羽広げ舞い上がれ 悲しみも痛みも包み込んで
spreading angel wings and soaring up, embracing both sorrow and pain.

236
00:19:49,527 --> 00:19:59,031
強くなれ明日
Grow stronger, tomorrow!

237
00:20:00,679 --> 00:20:02,479
大地を踏みしめて
Treading firmly on the ground,

238
00:20:02,479 --> 00:20:04,379
強くなれ明日は
grow stronger for tomorrow!

239
00:20:04,679 --> 00:20:07,879
君は目覚めていく
You are awakening

240
00:20:07,879 --> 00:20:10,579
天使の微笑みで
with an angel's smile,

241
00:20:10,579 --> 00:20:13,579
連れ出して
lead me away!

242
00:20:13,879 --> 00:20:19,279
始まりはいつでも遅くないさ
It's never too late to start over.

243
00:20:19,879 --> 00:20:23,579
何度でも！
No matter how many times!

244
00:20:23,579 --> 00:20:29,879
何度でも立ち上がれ！
Rise up over and over!

245
